# ============================================================
#  Hints toward the special offers (threads 2, docs/threads-2-plan.md): once each, where the hint would come from,
#  while the offer is open and its item not yet yours. The five shop offers' hints leave a Journal lead
#  (`lead_offer_*`, content/world/clues.grim) whatever you choose. While you hold it, a visit to the offer's place
#  is likely to open on the offer (its appointment below), and the counter's text mentions it. The two Whisperwood gifts already leave
#  their leads when you get them; their cards here are reminders, a month or more later.
# ============================================================

@appointment offer_ashwood_hinted
desc: While you hold the lead to Mir's ashwood wand, a visit to the square is likely to open on it.
at: visit
place: village
when: clue(lead_offer_ashwood)
chance: likely
deals: card offer_ashwood_wand

@appointment offer_ward_cloak_hinted
desc: While you hold the lead to the ward-thread cloak, a visit to the square is likely to open on it.
at: visit
place: village
